ear that he (isluhssiaal:) won the", "conf": 0.684, "box": [[101, 649], [792, 648], [792, 678], [101, 679]]}, {"text": "hearts of his friends and enemies by love, kindness and", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[101, 688], [740, 688], [740, 717], [101, 717]]}, {"text": "mercy and not by force. His Mercy was for all. Indeed,", "conf": 0.959, "box": [[101, 726], [718, 725], [718, 754], [101, 755]]}, {"text": "he (asiit)was Rahmatul-lil-Aalamin.Maypeacebe", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[100, 762], [780, 763], [780, 792], [100, 791]]}, {"text": "upon him!", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[101, 801], [225, 797], [226, 828], [102, 831]]}, {"text": "Vocabulary i", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[153, 897], [356, 906], [354, 946], [151, 937]]}, {"text": "COM", "conf": 0.636, "box": [[684, 926], [801, 808], [847, 854], [729, 972]]}, {"text": "1 Read the words with their meanings.", "conf": 0.847, "box": [[95, 981], [567, 990], [566, 1020], [94, 1011]]}, {"text": "Words", "conf": 0.81, "box": [[148, 1052], [236, 1052], [236, 1083], [148, 1083]]}, {"text": "Meaning", "conf": 0.774, "box": [[519, 1051], [633, 1056], [632, 1086], [517, 1082]]}, {"text": "take another person's child into your home for a period of time,", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[306, 1097], [1043, 1102], [1043, 1131], [306, 1126]]}, {"text": "foster-mother", "conf": 0.835, "box": [[113, 1116], [275, 1116], [275, 1143], [113, 1143]]}, {"text": "without becoming his or her legal parents.", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[307, 1131], [798, 1136], [798, 1166], [307, 1161]]}, {"text": "widow", "conf": 0.69, "box": [[112, 1179], [195, 1182], [194, 1214], [111, 1211]]}, {"text": "a woman whose husband has died.", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[307, 1186], [710, 1189], [710, 1216], [307, 1212]]}, {"text": "proposal", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[110, 1238], [220, 1234], [221, 1268], [111, 1272]]}, {"text": "an act of formally asking somebody to marry you.", "conf": 0.944, "box": [[309, 1238], [881, 1244], [881, 1273], [309, 1267]]}, {"text": "orphan", "conf": 0.789, "box": 